    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39321" root="نثر" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَثِرٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>Loquacious;</i> one <i>who talks much:</i> as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْثَرٌ</span></b>  (M, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَيْثُرَانٌ</span></b> : (Sgh, K:) or
<i>vainly</i> or <i>frivolously loquacious, and a divulger of
secrets:</i> (A:) fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَثِرَةٌ</span> only. (M.)

